<title>INDIA: Cut-off steady at 5.0 pct at India repos auction.</title>
<headline>Cut-off steady at 5.0 pct at India repos auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Saturday it kept the cut-off at five percent at its three-day repos auction of government of India securities, unchanged from the last auction.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received six bids for six billion rupees of which it accepted four for five billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off worked out to 4.97 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
